<del></del></span> Recommended Gear for Retribution Paladin in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="what-is-the-bis-retribution-paladin-gear">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="$color" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_questionmark.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> What is the BiS Retribution Paladin gear?</h3>In Mists of Pandaria Classic, just as in other expansions, due to the scarcity of loot drops and the variety of sources they are obtained from, targeting your absolute Best in Slot is often somewhat unrealistic; as a result we've broken down the best drops for Retribution Paladin in Phase 1 from raids, dungeons, Reputation, and World Bosses to help you decide what to prioritize. Due to the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/news/some-warlords-of-draenor-pre-patch-class-changes-coming-to-mists-of-pandaria-377239?utm_source=discord-webhook">class balance changes buffing Retribution Paladin</a>, our stat weights and therefore our "best in slot" gear will not necessarily be exactly the same as the set you may remember from the original Mists of Pandaria.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>While raid drops are generally the most reliable way of getting high item level gear, many other items can be just as good, if not better, so you should reference the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-stat-priority-pve">Stat Priorities for Retribution Paladin</a> to help determine your own BiS gear based on what is available to you. <br/>
<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="bis-gear">Overall Best in Slot Gear for Retribution Paladin</h3>Raids releases in Mists of Pandaria Classic will be staggered, with a few resets between each raid opening. This means that as the Phase progresses, more of your Best in Slot gear will become available to you. This also means that you will need to find alternatives until your Best in Slot items are available. Below we have included three gear planners, corresponding with each raid release.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
