<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Retribution Paladin in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The set bonuses available in Phase 1 are pretty solid, although they are slightly boring - offering raw damage increases on a few specific abilities. The tier items available in Phase 1 are Tier 14, and the items from this set will not be obtainable until specific raids release. The gloves, legs, and chest tier tokens are available from the second raid release - <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6297/heart-of-fear">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Fear</span></a>; the helm &amp; shoulder tier tokens will become available when <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6067/terrace-of-endless-spring">
