<br/>Overall this is a pretty solid tier set, with strong set bonuses and well-itemized pieces. Due to the fact that the set bonuses are raw damage increases on a few specific spells, the set bonuses will not impact your stat weights or gearing choices very much. As always, completing one of these set bonuses will typically be a higher priority over equipping other items. Since this is the first tier set obtainable after leveling to 90, and you won't be wearing a tier set already, there are no obstacles or other considerations stopping you from immediately upgrading to Tier 14 items upon obtaining them.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="trinkets">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/creatureportrait_cyclone_nodebris.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Retribution Paladin Trinkets in Phase 1</span></h2>Trinkets for Paladin DPS are rather straightforward as you will usually be selecting the trinkets with the highest item level, narrowed down to the trinkets that provide the most favorable stats - following our stat priority. Active trinkets should be used on cooldown as much as possible, unless aligned with specific boss damage taken increasing mechanics. They should also be stacked with &amp; overlap the duration of your class cooldowns, such as <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=31884/avenging-wrath">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_avenginewrath.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Avenging Wrath</span></a>, as much as possible.<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="best-trinkets">Best Trinkets</h5>Paladins should be wearing no more than one active on-use trinket, as two active trinkets cannot be stacked at the same time and share a short cooldown. Two passive trinkets, however, is completely fine - and our best in slot set will be using two passives. <br/>
<br/>
<ins>Active Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=81268/lessons-of-the-darkmaster">
<img alt="Lessons of the Darkmaster" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cat_trinket12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lessons of the Darkmaster</span></a> is the strongest trinket from heroic dungeons, and will be a pre-raid best in slot trinket until the point where lower level raid trinkets become available from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=3350/august-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="August Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendarygem_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">August Stone Fragment</span></span></a>. Additionally, due to the longer and more-powerful cooldown, it is also the best active on-use trinket in Phase 1.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=86042/jade-charioteer-figurine">
<img alt="Jade Charioteer Figurine" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mount_ridinghorse.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jade Charioteer Figurine</span></a> is a rather weak option due to the short 1-min cooldown that won't often overlap with our class cooldowns - all of the epic passive trinkets are better, as is <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=81268/lessons-of-the-darkmaster">
