<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="hit-expertise">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_marksmanship.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Reaching Hit and Expertise Cap for Retribution Paladin</span></h2>In Mists of Pandaria, the Hit &amp; Expertise caps will change slightly to 7.5% Hit and 7.5% Expertise when dealing damage against raid level bosses. Keep in mind that some abilities such as the <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_human_female.gif");'></span>
<b>Human</b> racial passive <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=20597/sword-specialization">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_meleedamage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sword Specialization</span></a> will contribute to your overall Hit and/<wbr/>or Expertise, reducing the amount needed from gear &amp; reforging.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hit-rating">Hit Rating</h4>At 7.5% Hit, our abilities and melee swings will no longer miss raid bosses <i>(+3 levels above you)</i>. When our attacks miss, we do not generate <a data-entity="resource" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/resource/holy-power-9">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Holy Power</span></a> or trigger <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=31801/seal-of-truth">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_sealofvengeance.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of Truth</span></a>, so it is very important to be Hit capped.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="expertise-rating">Expertise Rating</h4>At 7.5% Expertise, our abilities and melee swings will no longer be dodged by raid bosses <i>(+3 levels above you)</i>. They can still parry our attacks, if they are facing us, but we will almost always try to be behind them in order to avoid parries - as mobs cannot parry attacks from behind. When our attacks dodge or parry, we do not generate <a data-entity="resource" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/resource/holy-power-9">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Holy Power</span></a> or trigger <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=31801/seal-of-truth">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_sealofvengeance.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of Truth</span></a>, so it is very important to be Expertise capped.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="gemming">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_uncut_purple.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Gemming for Retribution Paladin</span></h2>We will generally prioritize stacking as much haste as possible, therefore we will primarily be using <span class="c4">Yellow</span>, <span class="c11">Orange</span>, or <span class="c3">Green</span> gems to complete our socket bonuses. It is generally worth going for every socket bonus, because we have strong haste gems we can use for any specific color.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="q9">Meta Gem</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76886/reverberating-primal-diamond">
<img alt="Reverberating Primal Diamond" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_metagem_cut.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reverberating Primal Diamond</span></a></div></li>
